<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Account on JASMIN Help Site</title><link>https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/tags/account/</link><description>Recent content in Account on JASMIN Help Site</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-gb</language><copyright>Copyright © 2025 Science and Technology Facilities Council.</copyright><atom:link href="https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/tags/account/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Get a login account</title><link>https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/docs/getting-started/get-login-account/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/docs/getting-started/get-login-account/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="get-a-login-account" class="heading "&gt;Get a login account&lt;a href="#get-a-login-account" aria-labelledby="get-a-login-account"&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- &lt;i class="fas fa-link anchor"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; --&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="svg-inline--fa fas fa-link anchor" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512"&gt;&lt;use href="#fas-link"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&amp;nbsp;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;A user with a &lt;code&gt;jasmin-login&lt;/code&gt; grant is allocated a &lt;code&gt;HOME&lt;/code&gt; directory of &lt;strong&gt;100GB&lt;/strong&gt; and can access the shared JASMIN servers (&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/docs/interactive-computing/sci-servers/"&gt;scientific servers&lt;/a&gt;, &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/docs/interactive-computing/transfer-servers/"&gt;data transfer servers&lt;/a&gt;) and &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/docs/batch-computing/lotus-overview/"&gt;the LOTUS batch cluster&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Multiple account types</title><link>https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/docs/getting-started/multiple-account-types/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://help.jasmin.ac.uk/docs/getting-started/multiple-account-types/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This article defines the types of account available on JASMIN and their&#10;purpose. It covers:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;STANDARD accounts (with note about training accounts)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;SHARED accounts&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;SERVICE accounts&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="introduction" class="heading "&gt;Introduction&lt;a href="#introduction" aria-labelledby="introduction"&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- &lt;i class="fas fa-link anchor"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; --&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="svg-inline--fa fas fa-link anchor" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512"&gt;&lt;use href="#fas-link"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&amp;nbsp;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;For some time, we have been asked by user communities to cater for legitimate&#10;use cases where accounts need to be shared by a small, known and pre-arranged&#10;set of users, or by services or functions.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>